WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.476
At dinnertime, the children sat around the table to eat.

2
00:00:04.477 --> 00:00:08.668
Bobby felt happy to be eating a meal again with his siblings.

3
00:00:08.669 --> 00:00:12.753
"How did you know I was at the well?" he asked them.

4
00:00:12.754 --> 00:00:16.293
"Aunt Martha was getting worried," Panther answered.

5
00:00:16.294 --> 00:00:18.583
"We hadn't seen you all day."

6
00:00:18.584 --> 00:00:26.064
"So when we couldn't find you, we decided to look in the woods," finished Cy.

7
00:00:26.065 --> 00:00:29.973
"That's enough, Jane," scolded Panther.

8
00:00:29.974 --> 00:00:33.401
Jane was taking more fried chicken than she could eat.

9
00:00:33.402 --> 00:00:35.281
"Leave those for Bobby."

10
00:00:35.282 --> 00:00:38.442
Panther took the plate away from her.

11
00:00:38.443 --> 00:00:42.974
"That's okay. Jane can have them all," smiled Bobby.

12
00:00:42.975 --> 00:00:45.910
The others stared at him in shock.

13
00:00:45.911 --> 00:00:48.372
"You've been acting strange.

14
00:00:48.373 --> 00:00:52.828
Are you okay?" Cy asked in a concerned voice.

15
00:00:52.829 --> 00:00:57.958
Bobby nodded and carefully asked, "What did you do today?"

16
00:00:57.959 --> 00:01:03.383
Cy yawned and replied, "It was really weird.

17
00:01:03.384 --> 00:01:06.102
I feel like I've been sleeping all day."

18
00:01:06.103 --> 00:01:08.673
"Me, too," said Panther.

19
00:01:08.674 --> 00:01:11.603
"And I don't remember doing anything."

20
00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:17.684
"I didn't have any dreams," Jane said, her mouth full of chicken.

21
00:01:17.685 --> 00:01:24.354
"Aunt Martha says she thinks we went to Mr. Keefer's, but she's not sure," said Panther.

22
00:01:24.355 --> 00:01:25.553
"Wait a minute."

23
00:01:25.554 --> 00:01:28.815
Cy looked at Bobby suspiciously.

24
00:01:28.816 --> 00:01:30.818
"Did you see Huey?

25
00:01:30.819 --> 00:01:33.353
What did you wish for?"

26
00:01:33.354 --> 00:01:39.205
So Bobby told them everything, and everyone listened and didn't say a word.

27
00:01:39.206 --> 00:01:43.233
After Bobby finished, he hung his head in shame.

28
00:01:43.234 --> 00:01:49.239
"I've always wondered what it would be like to be an only child," Panther said after a while.

29
00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:54.076
"It's no fun, I tell you," Bobby said with feeling.

30
00:01:54.077 --> 00:01:57.732
"I hope you appreciate what a great brother I am now,"

31
00:01:57.733 --> 00:02:01.453
said Cy, spreading his arms dramatically.

32
00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:05.196
As he did this, he accidentally knocked over the milk.

33
00:02:05.197 --> 00:02:09.440
It splashed all over Jane, and she screamed loudly.

34
00:02:09.441 --> 00:02:14.363
"Oh, Cy," Panther said in a motherly voice.

35
00:02:14.364 --> 00:02:20.180
Bobby grinned. Everything was back to normal again.

36
00:02:20.181 --> 00:02:23.598
The next morning, Jane was very excited.

37
00:02:23.599 --> 00:02:26.680
She hurried everyone through breakfast.

38
00:02:26.681 --> 00:02:30.042
It was her turn to make a wish.

39
00:02:30.043 --> 00:02:33.038
"Have you thought carefully about your wish?"

40
00:02:33.039 --> 00:02:35.704
Panther asked in a worried voice.

41
00:02:35.705 --> 00:02:39.035
"Of course," Jane said impatiently.

42
00:02:39.036 --> 00:02:44.002
"Maybe you should tell us what your wish is first," suggested Cy.

43
00:02:44.003 --> 00:02:47.661
"No," Jane said, shaking her head.

44
00:02:47.662 --> 00:02:49.739
"It's a surprise."

45
00:02:49.740 --> 00:02:52.616
The other children looked at each other.

46
00:02:52.617 --> 00:02:59.628
After their past experiences, they weren't as eager to make wishes as they had been before.

47
00:02:59.629 --> 00:03:04.813
"Come on," Jane said and headed toward the door.

48
00:03:04.814 --> 00:03:08.321
When they got to the well, Bobby held his breath.

49
00:03:08.322 --> 00:03:12.347
He remembered that the bucket would not move the day before.

50
00:03:12.348 --> 00:03:19.285
But Cy had no trouble as the rope smoothly pulled up the bucket, with Huey's shell inside.

51
00:03:19.286 --> 00:03:24.685
The children called for Huey for a few minutes before he finally stuck his head out.

52
00:03:24.686 --> 00:03:32.200
"Before you say anything," he started, "let me remind you once again."

53
00:03:32.201 --> 00:03:34.754
He lifted two fingers.

54
00:03:34.755 --> 00:03:39.847
"One, whatever you wish for ends at sunset.

55
00:03:39.848 --> 00:03:45.313
Two, after you make a wish you must not bother me."

56
00:03:45.314 --> 00:03:48.574
He stared at Bobby for a long time.

57
00:03:48.575 --> 00:03:51.353
Bobby looked down at his feet.

58
00:03:51.354 --> 00:03:59.418
"I cannot undo your wish," continued Huey, "so you have to think before you wish it."

59
00:03:59.419 --> 00:04:02.384
Everyone except Jane looked worried.

60
00:04:02.385 --> 00:04:07.016
Panther and the others wanted Jane to think before making a wish.

61
00:04:07.017 --> 00:04:11.914
"But it's my wish," Jane said, smiling to herself.

62
00:04:11.915 --> 00:04:17.104
"Can I make my wish now, Huey?" she whispered excitedly.

63
00:04:17.105 --> 00:04:21.303
And it was only fair that she wish for whatever she wanted.

64
00:04:21.304 --> 00:04:26.204
Jane clasped her hands together and, closing her eyes, she said,

65
00:04:26.205 --> 00:04:34.213
"I wish we had wings."

